QUERY NAME: qryAD6000_Delete1
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: DELETE

SQL:
DELETE MonthlyTime.*
FROM MonthlyTime
WHERE (((Exists (SELECT * FROM tblMTConversion WHERE (MonthlyTime.TimeCode = tblMTConversion.oldCode) AND (MonthlyTime.ParentProject = tblMTConversion.OldProject)))<>False) AND ((MonthlyTime.WorkGroup) Like 'SV*')  AND ((MonthlyTime.Month)<=GetgVarFMonth()));

